  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Evaluating Impact of Social Fund for Development Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Technical Assistance for Evaluating Impact of Social Fund for Development Programme is a component of Social Fund for Development Programme to Improve Access to Basic Social Services in Yemen. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;584,918. It works in the following sector(s): Social Protection, Education facilities and training, Health policy and administrative management, Democratic participation and civil society, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries, Agricultural development, Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
